sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant WebClient as Elm Web Client
  participant MobileClient as Native Mobile Client
  participant Channel as Phoenix Channel
  participant Repo as Thread Repo (Ecto)
  participant Shared as Shared Repo (users/bridges)
  participant Bridge as Bridge Worker
  participant Slack as Slack API

  WebClient->>Channel: sendMessage(payload, threadId)
  Channel->>Repo: persist to threads/{threadId}.db
  Repo-->>Channel: {:ok, message_id}
  Channel-->>WebClient: ack(message_id, status="sending")
  Channel->>Bridge: broadcast message event

  Bridge->>Shared: read bridge configuration
  Bridge->>Slack: POST chatMessage(payload, credentials)
  Slack-->>Bridge: delivery confirmation
  Bridge-->>Channel: delivery status update
  Channel-->>WebClient: update status="delivered"
  Channel-->>MobileClient: push delivered message

  Slack->>Bridge: new message webhook/poll
  Bridge->>Repo: persist inbound message
  Bridge->>Channel: broadcast inbound message
  Channel-->>WebClient: render inbound payload
  Channel-->>MobileClient: render inbound payload
